      "side": 1,
      "message": "Only the refspec decides what is checked out, so setting GERRIT_BRANCH to a stable branch while leaving this default still tests master, under the stable branch\u0027s name. Could we default this to empty and pass ${{ inputs.GERRIT_REFSPEC || inputs.GERRIT_BRANCH }} to compose-maven-verify, so an empty refspec means \"tip of the chosen branch\"?",
