      "writtenOn": "2026-11-19T12:37:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The group ignores TOX_ARGS, so dispatching a second subset of the same refspec (say -k etsi, then -k ietf) cancels the first run without a report. Could we append ${{ github.event.inputs.TOX_ARGS }} to the group, or drop cancel-in-progress for these manual runs?",
      "revId": "22c38fd90721e032adfa40cb3b1a897ef8f4832c",
      "serverId": "7fc14799-209e-464c-9743-7a06c2c21a81"
