      "writtenOn": "2026-11-19T12:37:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "id-token: write is visible to every step of this job, including Maven/tox/pytest running the change named by GERRIT_REFSPEC, so an unreviewed change\u0027s conftest.py could mint an OIDC token and assume AWS_LOG_ROLE_ARN. Acceptable for a hand-picked manual run, but it must not carry over into gerrit-verify.yaml. Could we note that here, and ideally get compose-maven-verify to publish logs from a separate job that runs no project code?",
      "revId": "22c38fd90721e032adfa40cb3b1a897ef8f4832c",
      "serverId": "7fc14799-209e-464c-9743-7a06c2c21a81"
